Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||06-25-2001||08:18 PM||||Just a question, which do you like better, the General Chat or the Technical fourm ?<P>I've spent more time in the General Chat fourm.<P>Seems to me, more of my questions go unanswered in the Technical forum.<P>Not trying to start any wars here, just  wanting to see how others feel.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Tweek||06-25-2001||08:46 PM||||As I have a lot of time on my hands, I temd to read everything (cept the club announcements cause Im not in a club, but still a good feature). <P>It is true that you will get more responses (imho) in general because more people can say how much they like their cars than can answer techie questions.<P>I am declining saying one is better than the other because I really think both are great, though I respond more in general (per reasons given above). ||||reg||1
